<title>UK: LB Rheinland-Pfalz prices 1.0 bln mark 7-year bond.</title>
<headline>LB Rheinland-Pfalz prices 1.0 bln mark 7-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earlier by joint lead managers Lehman Brothers Bankhaus AG and Morgan Stanley Bank AG, has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESBANK RHEINLAND-PFALZ GZ</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     5.75	MATURITY    16.OCT.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.48     PAY DATE    16.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  30 BP     REOFFER    99.48     SPREAD	+20 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND BUND DUE SEPTEMBER 2003</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
